findings.proposed_change:
Specify the diagnostic message format verbatim in AC-12. Concrete proposal: the synthesis aborts with stderr containing a machine-readable block: `BUCKET-MISMATCH
feature: {NNN-slug}
task: {T_id}
existing: {N_existing}
recomputed: {N_recomputed}
remediation: specflow:scope-change` — one block per mismatched task, all blocks emitted before the abort. Verify-step: `grep -c '^BUCKET-MISMATCH$' stderr.log` returns the expected number of edited tasks; `grep -A 5 '^BUCKET-MISMATCH$' stderr.log | grep -E '^task: (T1|T2|...)$'` lists each edited ID. Binary, naming both the count and the contents.
